menuconfig MODULES_COMMAND_PROCESSOR
	bool "command_processor"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for command_processor module

		Command Processor handles vehicle_command_s messages and dispatches them
		to vehicle-specific command handlers. It provides:
		- Vehicle-type specific command handling
		- Mode change request publishing (mode_change_request)
		- Automation task publishing (automation_task)
		- Command acknowledgment handling
